                  Diffusion Coefficients of Amino Acids in Aqueous Solutions', J. Chem. Eng.
                  Data 50 (2005) 1192, doi 10.1021/je049582g (closed).  (2) The INPUT: V0 ~
                  127.3 cm3/mol is FLAGGED, so the Stokes-Einstein radius that produced this D
